WEBVTT

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.270
I don't like rainy days.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.320
Poets love the chatter of the sun, and we do too.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:43.710
We agree, it's nice to see a smiling sky of blue.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:49.040
Sweat, the poets fret, sing a sad refrain.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:53.560
We can't see though, all folks can be so blue.

00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:59.970
The patter of the raindrops hit the wind.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:08.430
It can rain and rain and rain, but we never will complain, for we love to hear the raindrops as you play a little too.

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:43.080
Oh, we love it when it's raining, we are happy in the rain.

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:47.070
Though the sky is very gray, we are very, very gay.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:51.060
And we always feel like dancing to the rhythm of the rain.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:03.620
How did you like our song?

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.540
We liked it!

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.060
It sounded very happy, didn't it?

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:12.430
We're always happy.

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:16.220
Meet my friend, Mr. Coffee Pop.

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:18.090
We're glad to know you.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.030
Oh, that's all right.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:22.780
Bye, girlie, meet the wife.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:24.650
I'm glad to know you.

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:26.790
Too bad it rained.

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:27.830
Yeah!

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:32.950
Well, that's too bad.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:39.190
I remember one day when Mr. Coffee Pot and his wife took their family on a picnic.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:41.470
Yeah, but they didn't rain that day.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:00.350
You

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:31.890
You

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:00.370
Thank you.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:56.430
Give me this!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:03.790
Everybody fight.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.950
This game, shoot!

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:52.800
I hope that was the funniest technique I ever did see.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.300
When it's rainy in the rain

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:05.930
Though the sky is very gray

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:07.270
We are very, very gay

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:08.810
And we always feel like dancing

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:11.290
To the rhythm of the rain
